      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STOMP AND RUN (1) three runs back produced a speedy 29.83 win over 520m at Wentworth Park then has found the minor money in two runs since. Has the ability and looks a key chance again. JUST A BABE (2) overcame a check in the run and fought on to place in good time (31.10) at this track over 530m in a Grade 6. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. CITY OF LOVE (8) broke well and quickly mustered speed to win over the 455m at Murray Bridge two runs back then raced on speed again when finishing second at this track last start. Will give a great sight again. WAIKARIE KOBY (7) placed last start at this track and distance and is in the mix again.",
